nected to trade network** (if gold trading is available): previously this was hidden, and would require tediously opening the diplomacy screen of each player, and this is now also consistent with flat gold being shown in techs tab for all players (if gold trading is available). See [KI#132](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#132---enhanced-base-advciv-issue-of-not-showing-rival-gold-per-turn-on-foreign-trade-advisor-bonuses-tab-when-not-connected-to-their-trade-network).
